.TH XIL\-STEM\-VERIFY "1" "2026\-08\-09" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-stem\-verify
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-stem\-verify
[-h] [--show SLUG] [--episode TAG] [--stems-dir DIR] [--output FILE] [--whisper-python PATH] [--model SIZE] [--language LANG] [--beam-size N] [--device {cuda,cpu}] [--no-transcribe]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scan a stems folder and produce a JSON report with file attributes and Whisper transcriptions.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SLUG\/\fR, \fB\-s\fR \fI\,SLUG\/\fR
Show slug (default: resolved from project.json or XIL_PROJECTROOT)

.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR, \fB\-e\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Episode tag, e.g. S01E01 (required unless \-\-stems\-dir is set)

.TP
\fB\-\-stems\-dir\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Override stems directory (default: <workspace>/stems/<slug>/<episode>/)

.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Output JSON path (default:
<workspace>/parsed/<slug>/stem_verify_<episode>.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-whisper\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to venv\-whisper Python executable (auto\-detected if omitted)

.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI\,SIZE\/\fR
Whisper model size: tiny|base|small|medium|large\-v3|large\-v3\-turbo (default:
large\-v3\-turbo)

.TP
\fB\-\-language\fR \fI\,LANG\/\fR
Language hint for Whisper. Use 'auto' for automatic detection (default: en)

.TP
\fB\-\-beam\-size\fR \fI\,N\/\fR
Whisper beam size (default: 5)

.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI\,{cuda,cpu}\/\fR
Compute device for Whisper (default: cuda)

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-transcribe\fR
Skip Whisper transcription; output file attributes only

